          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>It can drop straight into your missed-call inbox, voicemail or web form and reply for you, or it can simply draft the reply for you to review. You decide which.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q2</span>
          <h4>Will it work with my job book or CRM?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Yes. Use it alongside ServiceM8, Tradify, Jobber, Powered Now or just WhatsApp and a spreadsheet. It fits around what you already use.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q3</span>
          <h4>What about my prices and certs?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>We set your day rate, common parts pricing, deposit policy and Gas Safe / NICEIC / RECC wording at setup. Every quote and message uses your numbers, not generic ones.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q4</span>
          <h4>Will the customer know it's AI?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Messages are drafted in your voice and you review before sending. The customer sees a normal message from your business — same number, same tone.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="qa-head">
          <span class="qn">Q5</span>
          <h4>Can it draft invoices and chase payment?</h4>
          <span class="qa-tog">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="qa-body"><p>Yes. Deposit reminders, materials invoices, final invoices and overdue chase messages — all drafted from the actual job. You review before sending.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="qa-head">
